msgctxt "custom/004/HouFixCompanySubmarine_00447:TEXT_HOUFIXCOMPANYSUBMARINE_00447_SUBMARINE_NAME_TITLE:1"
msgid "Rename your submersible."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 潜水艦の名前
#. de: Name des Tauchboots
#. fr: Nom du sous-marin
msgctxt "custom/004/HouFixCompanySubmarine_00447:TEXT_HOUFIXCOMPANYSUBMARINE_00447_SUBMARINE_NAME_CAPTION:1"
msgid "Submersible Name"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <br>名前には、アルファベット・数字・スペースと<br>以下の記号が使用できます。<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>‘. , : ; ! ? & - _</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>•スペースや_は2文字以上続けて使えません。<br>•先頭や末尾にスペースがある名前は使えません。<br>•記号だけの名前は使えません。
#. de: Du kannst Buchstaben, Ziffern, die Leertaste und folgende Zeichen verwenden:<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>'. , : ; ! ? & - _</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Zwei oder mehr aufeinanderfolgende Leerzeichen sind nicht möglich.<br>Das erste und letzte Zeichen darf kein Leerzeichen sein.<br>Ein Name nur aus Satzzeichen ist nicht möglich.
#. fr: Le nom peut comprendre des lettres non accentuées, des chiffres, des espaces ou les symboles suivants<nbsp>:<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>'<nbsp>. ,<nbsp>:<nbsp>;<nbsp>!<nbsp>? & - _</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>- Deux espaces ou deux tirets bas ne peuvent pas se suivre.<br>- Il ne peut pas commencer ou se terminer par une espace.<br>- Il ne peut pas être composé uniquement de symboles.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <nbsp> — a non-breaking space (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/004/HouFixCompanySubmarine_00447:TEXT_HOUFIXCOMPANYSUBMARINE_00447_SUBMARINE_NAME_MES_0:1"
msgid "Names must be formed from alphanumeric characters. The following punctuation marks are also allowed:<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>'<nbsp>. , : ; ! ? & - _</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>• Double spaces/underscores are not allowed.<br>• A space cannot be used before or after the name.<br>• Names consisting solely of punctuation marks are prohibited."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 潜水艦 <string $s1> を解体します。<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>装備中のアイテムは返還されますが、<br>「潜水艦登録手形」は返還されません。<br>潜水艦のランクなどの情報は、すべてクリアされます。<br></ui-edge-color></ui-color>本当によろしいですか？
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Achtung: Die Bauteile erhältst du zurück, nicht aber die Registriermarken. Daten wie der Rang des Tauchboots werden nicht gespeichert.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Das Tauchboot wirklich demontieren?
#. fr: Le sous-marin “<string $s1>” va être démonté. Confirmer<nbsp>?<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Les éléments seront récupérés, mais les frais d'enregistrement, le rang et l'expérience seront perdus.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <string $s1> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/004/HouFixCompanySubmarine_00447:TEXT_HOUFIXCOMPANYSUBMARINE_00447_REMOVE_SUBMARINE_TITLE:1"
msgid "Are you certain you wish to dismantle <i><string $s1></i>?<br><ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Please note that while submersible components will be returned, your submersible's registration, rank, and accrued experience will be lost.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 潜水艦を解体する
#. de: Demontieren
#. fr: Démonter le sous-marin
msgctxt "custom/004/HouFixCompanySubmarine_00447:TEXT_HOUFIXCOMPANYSUBMARINE_00447_REMOVE_SUBMARINE_CHECK:1"
msgid "Dismantle Submersible."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 潜水艦の登録には、<br>「潜水艦登録手形」と「潜水艦パーツ」が必要です。
#. de: Zur Registrierung sind Tauchboot-Bauteile sowie eine Gebühr in Form von Registriermarken erforderlich.
#. fr: Pour équiper et enregistrer un sous-marin, vous devez être en possession des éléments nécessaires et d'un “formulaire d'enregistrement de sous-marin”.
msgctxt "custom/004/HouFixCompanySubmarine_00447:TEXT_HOUFIXCOMPANYSUBMARINE_00447_NO_REGISTRATION_1:1"
msgid "To outfit and register a submersible, you must have in your possession the requisite components and dive credits."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「潜水艦登録手形」は、居住区担当官から、<br>カンパニークレジットと交換することで入手できます。
#. de: Registriermarken können beim Unterkunftsbeamten mit Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaftstalern gekauft werden.
#. fr: Les <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>formulaires d'enregistrement de sous-marin</ui-edge-color></ui-color> peuvent être achetés auprès des officiers du logement contre des crédits de compagnie.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/004/HouFixCompanySubmarine_00447:TEXT_HOUFIXCOMPANYSUBMARINE_00447_NO_REGISTRATION_2:1"
msgid "<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dive credits</ui-edge-color></ui-color> can be purchased from resident caretakers with company credits."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「潜水艦パーツ」は、<br>「艦体」「艦尾」「艦首」「艦橋」の4種類が必要です。<br>これらは「カンパニー製作設備」で製作することで入手できます。
#. de: Vier verschiedene Tauchboot-Bauteile sind nötig: Rumpf-, Brücke-, Bug- und Heckteile. Sie können in der Produktionsanlage der Freien Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft hergestellt werden.
#. fr: Les <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>éléments de sous-marin</ui-edge-color></ui-color> (coque, pont, proue et poupe) peuvent être construits dans l'atelier de compagnie.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/004/HouFixCompanySubmarine_00447:TEXT_HOUFIXCOMPANYSUBMARINE_00447_NO_REGISTRATION_3:1"
msgid "<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Submersible components</ui-edge-color></ui-color> can be constructed in your company workshop. Please note that hull, stern, bow, and bridge components are required to outfit a submersible."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 潜水艦の出港には、「青燐水バレル」が必要となります。<br>「青燐水バレル」は、居住区担当官から、<br>カンパニークレジットと交換することで入手できます。
#. de: Tauchboote benötigen Erdseim als Treibstoff. Erdseim-Fässer können beim Unterkunftsbeamten mit Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaftstalern gekauft werden.
#. fr: Vous ne pouvez pas expédier un sous-marin de compagnie sans barils de céruleum. Ces derniers peuvent être achetés auprès des officiers du logement contre des crédits de compagnie.
msgctxt "custom/004/HouFixCompanySubmarine_00447:TEXT_HOUFIXCOMPANYSUBMARINE_00447_NO_ENERGY:1"
msgid "You cannot deploy your submersible on subaquatic voyages without ceruleum tanks, which can be purchased from resident caretakers with company credits."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 潜水艦の探索が完了すると「ボイジャー報告」が発行され、<br>各目的地での探索が、どのような結果となったのか、<br>詳細を確認することができます。
#. de: Wenn eine Erkundung abgeschlossen ist, kann das Logbuch eingesehen werden, in dem alle Aktivitäten festgehalten sind.
#. fr: À la fin d'une expédition, le pantin de l'atelier vous remettra le <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>journal d'expédition</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/004/HouFixCompanySubmarine_00447:TEXT_HOUFIXCOMPANYSUBMARINE_00447_NO_EXPLOG_1:1"
msgid "Upon the completion of a subaquatic voyage, your mammet will provide a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>voyage log</ui-edge-color></ui-color> detailing the results."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「ボイジャー報告」には、探索のヒントとなる情報も載っています。<br>より良い探索の攻略を目指し、<br>潜水艦の装備を、工夫してみてください。
#. de: Dieses Logbuch liefert Hinweise für die nächste Erkundungsreise. So kann die Effizienz der Erkundungen immer mehr erhöht werden.
#. fr: Les in<shy>for<shy>ma<shy>tions sur les événements survenus au cours de l'exploration peuvent s'avérer utiles pour de futures expéditions.
msgctxt "custom/004/HouFixCompanySubmarine_00447:TEXT_HOUFIXCOMPANYSUBMARINE_00447_NO_EXPLOG_2:1"
msgid "The information contained in this log may prove useful in preparing for your next subaquatic voyage."
msgstr ""

#. ja: また、「ボイジャー報告」は「過去1回分」が保存されるため、<br>フリーカンパニーのメンバー同士で内容を確認しあい、<br>次に製作する「潜水艦パーツ」を、一緒に考えてみましょう。
#. de: Allerdings wird immer nur der letzte Logbucheintrag angezeigt. Wenn du ihn aber mit denen der Erkundungen anderer Mitglieder der Freien Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft vergleichst, werdet ihr sicher herausfinden, wie ihr euer Tauchboot am besten ausstatten könnt.
#. fr: Notez que seul le journal de la dernière expédition en date sera conservé.
msgctxt "custom/004/HouFixCompanySubmarine_00447:TEXT_HOUFIXCOMPANYSUBMARINE_00447_NO_EXPLOG_3:1"
msgid "Please note that only the log for the previous voyage will be retained."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「潜水艦パーツ」の修理には、<br>「魔導機械修理材」が必要です。
#. de: Tauchboot-Bauteile können mit speziellen Magitek-Reparaturkits repariert werden.
#. fr: Pour réparer les éléments de votre sous-marin, vous devez impérativement posséder des “kits de réparation d'appareil”.
msgctxt "custom/004/HouFixCompanySubmarine_00447:TEXT_HOUFIXCOMPANYSUBMARINE_00447_NO_REPAIR_ITEM:1"
msgid "You cannot repair submersible components without the requisite materials."
msgstr ""
